----

= Trust Recommendations =

You ranged DPS, no self-buffs — you need: tank, healer, melee DPS to fill the gap, and **Flurry** for ranged haste.

{{html clean="false"}}
<table class="gt">
<thead><tr><th style="width:60px;">Slot</th><th style="width:200px;">Trust</th><th>Why</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td class="lv">1</td><td>🛡️ <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Rughadjeen">Rughadjeen</a></strong></td><td>Tank with 75% cure threshold + sleep wake — high healing output frees a healer slot</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lv">2</td><td>✨ <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Koru-Moru">Koru-Moru</a></strong></td><td>Casts <strong>Flurry on ranged</strong> (you!) — the only trust that does this. Plus Haste on melee, Refresh, debuffs</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lv">3</td><td>🎵 <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Joachim">Joachim</a></strong></td><td>Madrigal for accuracy, March for speed, Elegy on mob</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lv">4</td><td>⚔️ <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Zeid_II">Zeid II</a></strong></td><td>Melee DPS + 4 stun interrupts (WS / MS / JA / casting)</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lv">5</td><td>⚔️ <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Ayame">Ayame</a></strong></td><td>Self-sufficient SAM DPS (Hasso / Third Eye / Meditate)</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
{{/html}}

